sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant GW as Inference Gateway (Envoy)<br/>443/80 TCP
    participant IPP as payload-processor<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS (self-signed)
    participant EPP as llm-d-router EPP / InferencePool
    participant MS as Model Server Pod
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Client,MS: Flow 1 - Payload-aware routing (Istio provider, failure_mode_allow false)
    Client->>GW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/HTTP, auth per Gateway policy
    GW->>IPP: ext_proc stream: request headers + body<br/>TLS, insecureSkipVerify, no client auth
    Note over IPP: Buffer body to EndOfStream<br/>pre-processors → profile picker → request plugins
    IPP-->>GW: Header mutations X-Gateway-Model-Name,<br/>X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name + body mutations
    GW->>EPP: Route by injected headers (HTTPRoute match)
    EPP->>MS: Selected endpoint<br/>protocol / TLS per backend
    MS-->>GW: Inference response
    GW->>IPP: ext_proc: response headers + body (same stream, 9004/TCP TLS)
    Note over IPP: Response post-processors
    IPP-->>GW: Response mutations
    GW-->>Client: Response

    Note over IPP,K8s: Flow 2 - Adapter mapping discovery
    IPP->>K8s: Watch ConfigMaps (HTTPS 6443, TLS 1.2+)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>IPP: ConfigMap events → informer cache<br/>app-side filter ipp-managed=true

    Note over Prom,K8s: Flow 3 - Metrics scrape
    Prom->>IPP: GET /metrics 9090/TCP plain HTTP<br/>Bearer token (default)
    IPP->>K8s: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS 6443 (RBAC not shipped → likely denied)
    K8s-->>IPP: Review result
    IPP-->>Prom: Metrics or 401/403
